WEBVTT

00:54:28.750 --> 00:54:33.434
and I guess it's exciting in the way

00:54:33.458 --> 00:54:35.434
that I think falling in love is exciting.

00:54:35.458 --> 00:54:39.643
EP: So how come the age
where we want passion the most at work,

00:54:39.667 --> 00:54:43.083
is the age where we stay 
about an average of two years?

00:54:44.625 --> 00:54:46.684
I mean, isn't it interesting
that the moment

00:54:46.708 --> 00:54:50.643
where we have the highest
set of expectations about this thing

00:54:50.667 --> 00:54:54.351
is also the time
where we are roaming and nomadic.

00:54:54.375 --> 00:54:56.309
AG: Yeah, I think that's a huge problem.

00:54:56.333 --> 00:54:58.809
EP: How do you understand it?
You have the students.

00:54:58.833 --> 00:55:00.976
You know, I see students who tell me,